ainland's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  under significant upward pressure. \par \par \uc2  It has also caused the PBoC's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to balloon to over US$134 billion, according to the latest figures. \par \par \uc2  Traders, however, cite China's strong export surplus and heavy direct investment inflows, and say they expect the yuan to remain under steady upward pressure for the foreseeable future. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES ASIAN EQUITIES REPORT  18-11-97 \par \par \uc2  0505GMT \par \par \uc2  1153 \par \par \uc2 Dokument aer0000020011005dtbi004ez\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
