\par\par \b \uc2  HK's Fin Sec/HKMA -2: Tung Sees 'Tremendous Determination' \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Oktober 1997\par 11:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-Dow Jones)--Hong Kong's two top monetary officials on Thursday reiterated their determination to hold the Hong Kong dollar peg in place, saying that interest rates will have to be high and the economy will have to endure pain. \par \par \uc2  Speaking separately from England, where he is on an official visit, Hong Kong Chief Executive Tung Chee-hwa said 'there is tremendous determination' to maintain the link, which values US$1.00 at HK$7.8000. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been fighting speculators since Wednesday night, local time, said the officials in Hong Kong. Financial Secretary Donald Tsang Yam-kuen said the HKMA has been using its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to buy U.S. dollars and defend the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and that reserves currently amount to US$88.1 billion. \par \par \uc2  HKMA Chief Executive Joseph Yam Chi-kwong said some 'big names' are sitting on 'short' Hong Kong dollar positions and are losing the battle because interest rates have gone so high. \par \par \uc2  Financial Secretary Tsang said he isn't cutting the official Hong Kong gross domestic product growth expectation for this year, but if he does so, it wouldn't fall under 5.0.%. Currently, the government is predicting the economy will expand 5.5% in 1997. \par \par \uc2  Tsang said \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't had a role in the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  efforts, either in the stock market or in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 23-10-97 \par \par \uc2  0926GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtan07xs1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
