\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 China \highlight\uc2  Yuan Ends Lower On  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 September 1997\par 06:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI (AP-Dow Jones)--The yuan ended narrowly lower Tuesday on a technical correction spurred by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  At the Shanghai-based \b \highlight22\uc2 China Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Trading Center, the dollar ended Tuesday at 8.2887 yuan, up from Monday's close of 8.2876 yuan. \par \par \uc2  After posting three days of consecutive gains, the yuan reversed course on the back of strong dollar buying from the People's Bank of China, a trader at the exchange said. The PBoC, China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , requires all \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  entering the country to be converted into yuan, which has put great pressure on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to strengthen given the net inflow of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  To avoid the negative effects of a stronger \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the PBoC often actively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  Meantime, the Japanese yen ended at 6.8410 yuan per 100 yen, down from Monday's close of 6.8860 yuan. The Hong Kong dollar closed at 1.0685 yuan, down from Monday's 1.0700 yuan. \par \par \uc2  In the non-deliverable forward market, which gives an indication of how participants expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to trade in the coming few months, money broker Exco Group in Singapore on Monday was quoting the U.S. dollar at 8.4680 yuan for delivery in six months and at 8.6030 yuan over a one-year timeframe. \par \par \uc2  As the yuan is only convertible under the current account, trade in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is driven by commercial demand and not speculation, which is prohibited. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also enforces narrow trading margins for the yuan, both with official price limits for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a strong trading presence stabilizing even slight fluctuations. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 02-09-97 \par \par \uc2  0455GMT \par \par \uc2  1153 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9206g1t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
