\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 China central bank intervenes \highlight\uc2  to halt yuan rise. \b0\par\par\uc2 350 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juli 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, July 30 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's yuan \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ended unchanged at 8.2900 to the dollar on Wednesday as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from breaching the key psychological level, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said banks tried to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  above the 8.2900 level but selling, believed to be from the People's Bank of China, emerged to halt any advance. \par \par \uc2  Dealers had seen a more relaxed stance by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  towards the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength, particularly out of concern that it not allow recent weakness of other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to affect the yuan. \par \par \uc2  But the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , despite its concerns over \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculation elsewhere in Asia, apparently did not want the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to push through the psychological barrier just yet. \par \par \uc2  "The 8.2900 level is a very important psychological point," said another dealer. "If it is breached, the yuan will rise sharply. So the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to depress the yuan as soon as it tested that level." \par \par \uc2  Other dealers agreed with that assessment but they added the trading level may still be breached before too long. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  prefers a steady movement of the yuan, which it thinks is beneficial to China's economy," another dealer said. \par \par \uc2  "But if fundamentals continue to support the yuan, it will be hard for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep it below the 8.2900 level over the longer term," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The yuan briefly hit a high of 8.2899 but it traded between 8.2902/8.2905 for most of the session. It opened at 8.2900 and hit a low of 8.2945 during a brief bout of speculative selling with the weighted average price on Tuesday at 8.2903. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they expected the yuan to hold steady near 8.2900 on Thursday. The yuan closed up at 7.0083 from 7.0526 against 100 Japanese yen and up at an intraday high of 1.0696 from 1.0700 against the Hong Kong dollar. \par \par \uc2  -- Shanghai newsroom (86-21) 6279-7004 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt7u01unx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
