\par\par \b \uc2  Chinese yuan ends down vs dollar on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 304 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juni 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, June 5 (Reuter) - The Chinese yuan ended down at a one-month low of 8.2941 on Thursday from Wednesday's 8.2914 against the U.S. dollar in Shanghai due to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the People's Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  The close was the lowest from May 5 when the yuan ended at 8.2947. The weighted average price on Wednesday was 8.2915. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen buying dollars in the last 15 minutes of trading to depress the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came after an upward trend in recent weeks on strong pro-yuan sentiment mainly supported by China's heavy foreign trade surplus, they said. \par \par \uc2  The yuan opened unchanged at 8.2914 and hit an intraday high of 8.2913 early in trading. It then fell slightly to move around the 8.2920 level for most of the session, hitting a sudden intraday low of 8.2990 in late trading, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Trading was more active than on Wednesday with most business done at 8.2920, traders said. \par \par \uc2  One dealer said it was the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that caused the yuan to close sharply lower. \par \par \uc2  "Beside the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action, no one else on the market could depress the yuan so sharply," he said. \par \par \uc2  A second dealer said the sudden intraday low was possibily due to follow-up speculative selling after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  He said he expected the yuan to have a technical rebound on Friday after Thursday's sharp fall. \par \par \uc2  The yuan closed almost unchanged at 7.1355 from 7.1340 against 100 Japanese yen and slightly up at 1.0702 from 1.0705 against the Hong Kong dollar. \par \par \uc2  -- Shanghai newsroom (86-21) 6279-7004 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt6504djd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
