\par\par \b \uc2  China Yuan Drops Against Dollar On Technical Correction \b0\par\par\uc2 222 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Mai 1997\par 06:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI (AP-Dow Jones)--The yuan declined moderately against U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday, backed by a slight technical correction, traders said. \par \par \uc2  At the Shanghai-based China \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Trading Center, the dollar ended Wednesday at 8.2924 yuan, a gain from Tuesday's close of 8.2917 yuan. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's gain Wednesday was linked to a technical correction after the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent declining trend, a trader with a local commercial bank said. \par \par \uc2  Dollar buying was constant through the session with few signs of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Yet, traders expect the dollar's downward trend to resume later in the week due to increased foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflows. \par \par \uc2  The Japanese yen ended at 7.2600 yuan per Y100, down from Tuesday's close of 7.2830 yuan. The Hong Kong dollar ended at 1.0712 yuan, down from Tuesday's 1.0723. \par \par \uc2  As the yuan is only convertible under the current account, trade in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is driven by commercial demand, and not speculation, which is prohibited. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also enforces narrow trading margins for the yuan, both with official price limits for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a strong trading presence stabilizing even slighter fluctuations in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  values. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0431GMT \par \par \uc2  1153 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5l03kr8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
