\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 / \highlight22\uc2 China \highlight\uc2 /HK Dlr -3: Many Changes In 1997 \b0\par\par\uc2 287 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Februar 1997\par 11:39\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  'It is certainly a way China is honoring its pledge over the past year or so that it will be behind the Hong Kong dollar-U.S. dollar peg,' Low said. \par \par \uc2  'We have to understand it's very important for China to see that Hong Kong, as well as other markets, remain stable after the death news of Deng Xiaoping, because China itself is facing lots of changes this year, with both the handover of Hong Kong and the 15th Party Congress,' he added. \par \par \uc2  Low said the rumored activity by the Bank of China lends credence to talk that either official or semiofficial mainland entities would just as easily step in to defend the Hong Kong stock market if it comes under heavy selling pressure close to the July 1 handover. \par \par \uc2  China has been long-rumored to have created a stabilization fund for the Hong Kong stock market, though \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Dai Xianglong denied its existence on a visit to Hong Kong last year. \par \par \uc2  'If they go through these semiofficial channels or official channels, the bottom line is still the same,' Low said. 'It shows China still has the will to defend Hong Kong's financial markets.' \par \par \uc2  Other participants were steadfast in saying there was no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  or concerted action to support the Hong Kong dollar Thursday. \par \par \uc2  'All markets reacted without any official or unofficial \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said Bruno Boussard, head of Banque Nationale de Paris's Hong Kong treasury division. \par \par \uc2  Boussard said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was volatile but moved in line with other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and equity markets, falling early, then recovering later in the day. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1039GMT \par \par \uc2  1136 4203 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2k0178g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
