\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 / \highlight22\uc2 China \highlight\uc2 /HK Dlr -2: Pledges To Use Reserves \b0\par\par\uc2 320 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Februar 1997\par 11:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  More importantly, however, bankers credited the departed leader, who died of respiratory failure at the age of 92, with helping to fashion the unshakable belief that China and Hong Kong stand as one when it comes to maintaining the territory's prosperity. \par \par \uc2  'The Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , alone, is enough to defend the market. On top of that, we've got China,' said Stanley Wong, head of Standard Chartered Bank's Hong Kong treasury \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . 'We can...reasonably believe they're willing to throw in some dollars to defend the peg,' he added. \par \par \uc2  The People's Bank of China has pledged it would use a portion of its US$105.0 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to help defend the Hong Kong dollar peg if the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's US$63.8 billion isn't enough. \par \par \uc2  Several participants said it wasn't the People's Bank of China, but the commercial Bank of China, that was supporting the territory's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday. \par \par \uc2  They said Bank of China bought Hong Kong dollars in early trading, knocking the U.S. dollar down from the HK$7.7495 level at which it had held between 1930 GMT Wednesday (2:00 p.m. EST) and 0145 GMT Thursday (7:45 p.m. EST). \par \par \uc2  Other rumors had China's primary \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  bank, together with the territory's largest bank, Hongkong Bank, buying Hong Kong dollars at the behest of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Neither the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  nor Hongkong Bank would comment on the rumors, and Bank of China traders didn't return several phone calls. \par \par \uc2  Chi Low, senior emerging markets economist at London-based \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analysis firm, I.D.E.A, said he couldn't confirm the Bank of China's rumored activity, but that it wouldn't surprise him if the rumor were true. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1006GMT \par \par \uc2  1136 4203 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2k0176f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
