\par\par \b \uc2  Stock exchanges China's most open markets - analysts. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Graham Earnshaw \par \uc2 496 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Januar 1997\par 09:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, Jan 14 (Reuter) - China's stock exchanges remain the most open and most market-driven financial markets in the country despite recent official pressure to rein them in, analysts said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , interbank and treasury bill repurchase markets are kept under incredibly tight control by the Beijing authorities, with even tiny movements achieved only with official approval. \par \par \uc2  "Unlike the stock markets, the funds moving on the money markets are directly linked to China's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stability and money supply," said one interbank market trader. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is afraid that any chaos on the markets could result in financial turmoil at either a national or local level," he added. \par \par \uc2  China's futures markets, once home to frenzied, casino-like trading, have been ruthlessly brought to heel over the past year with the authorities forcing speculative funds out to the stock markets, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  "Stocks are the most open of all China's financial markets," said a stock analyst with a major Chinese brokerage. "There was the crackdown in late 1996, but in fact the central government rarely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the markets." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stock markets in Shanghai and Shenzhen plunged in mid-December after the official People's Daily published an article warning of over-heating. Prices are now about 30 percent below their mid-December levels. \par \par \uc2  Current rules allow for a maximum 10 percent rise or fall in a share price over one trading day, but information flow, while still behind the standards of advanced stock exchanges abroad, is relatively free, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  On the nation's interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading market, by contrast, the People's Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 China intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily on a daily basis to keep movements in the Chinese yuan against other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  within very strict guidelines. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has its own trading room on the market, which has access to all transaction details, while dealers from other players on the market can only see trades done by their own bank. \par \par \uc2  Daily volumes are not posted on the market and rate movements of the Chinese yuan against other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are strictly limited, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "We feel very much that we are in an infair position with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  knowing everything and us knowing so little," said a Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader. \par \par \uc2  "The tendency therefore is for us not to bother to think or analyse the markets too much. Most of the trading is done in the dark with us just guessing at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's intentions," he added. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the same situation existed on the Chinese yuan interbank market, launched just one year ago, and on the nation's state debt repurchase markets. \par \par \uc2  They said another factor was that the bulk of funds moving on the money markets were state assets. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not stand by and let them get lost in uncontrolled trading," said one trader. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt1e06bps\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
