\par\par \b \uc2  Yuan closes down at intra-day low vs US dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 November 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, Nov 6 (Reuter) - The Chinese yuan closed at an intra-day low of 8.2980 against the U.S. dollar on Wednesday, slightly down from Tuesday's 8.2979, on the Shanghai-based interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said that the yuan was capped at about 8.2970, probably because of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the People's Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The yuan opened slightly higher at 8.2977 and moved around 8.2975 for most of the session, hitting an intra-day high of 8.2970 before closing at a low. \par \par \uc2  Trading was extremely dull, with most done at 8.2975, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "Selling of the dollar for the yuan triggered by China's increasing trade surplus was still strong and made the yuan's bottom-line solid," said one dealer. \par \par \uc2  "But \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  limited the yuan's rise at the topside and kept it in a narrow range," he added. \par \par \uc2  But a second dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had reduced its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market recently because of concerns over inflation. \par \par \uc2  "That's why the yuan could breach the key 8.3000 resistance level in the last week," he said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that the potential for further rises of the yuan was limited and it would move around 8.2980 on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The yuan closed up at 7.2610 from 7.2910 against 100 Japanese yen and slightly up at 1.0738 from 1.0740 against the Hong Kong dollar. \par \par \uc2  -- Shanghai newsroom (86-21) 6279-7004 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018dsb600trn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
