\par\par \b \uc2  China/Taiwan-2: Taiwan Govt Spending To Stabilize Markets \b0\par\par\uc2 280 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1996\par 01:08\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  On Friday, Beijing announced a third round of military exercises that will wrap around Taiwan-controlled islands near China. On Saturday, a Foreign Ministry spokesman reiterated China's long-held position that it won't renounce the use of force to recover Taiwan. \par \par \uc2  At the same time, though, Beijing sent the clearest signals yet that it isn't intent on hurting Taiwan's economy, with official news accounts explicitly separating economic and political interests in the cross-straits relationship. \par \par \uc2  'It is our sincere hope that the people of Taiwan can live their lives in peace and stability. I don't think it is difficult to achieve,' Chinese Premier Li Peng said Sunday. \par \par \uc2  Saying \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  wouldn't brook military \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by outside forces - a thinly disguised warning to U.S. warships that have gathered to monitor China's exercises - Li appeared even to accept the prospect of Lee Teng-hui's near-certain victory this weekend. \par \par \uc2  'What is most important is that the leader of Taiwan, no matter how he is selected, refrain from carrying out actions aimed at creating `two Chinas' or leading to independence for Taiwan in the future,' he said. Those comments may help to soothe the markets. \par \par \uc2  Since the beginning of the month, the government and leading banks and insurance companies have thrown close to $1 billion a week at the market - down 13% since last June - accounting for up to one-third of daily trading volume. \par \par \uc2  The government has pledged another $11 billion if tensions persist, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has spent heavily to stabilize the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-03-96 \par \par \uc2  0008GMT \par \par \uc2  1119 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds3i02hlg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
