\par\par \b \uc2  China  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  seen depreciating on 1996 imports. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Jane Macartney \par \uc2 524 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Januar 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BEIJING, Jan 24 (Reuter) - A surge in imports in 1996, fuelled by China's slashing of import tariffs from April 1, is likely to result in a slight fall in the renminbi yuan \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the dollar, analysts said on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  However, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the People's Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 , would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the fledgling \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if fluctuations became too extreme, the official Xinhua news agency quoted a bank official as saying. \par \par \uc2  A surge in China's trade surplus last year founded on a rush to export to take advantage of VAT export rebates had helped to push up the yuan against the dollar in 1995, but that trend was expected to reverse this year, the economists said. \par \par \uc2  The yuan climbed 1.56 percent to 8.3174 at the end of last year from 8.4462 at the start of 1995 and the trade surplus leapt to $16.69 billion in 1995 compared with a surplus of $5.345 billion the year before. \par \par \uc2  "The overall situation of the supply and demand of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to be favourable for a stable yuan," Xinhua quoted an official of the State Administration of Exchange Control (SAEC) as saying. \par \par \uc2  He forecast a drop in the surplus in 1995, due partly to a cut in the general import tariff level by 35 percent to an average 23 percent on April 1 and a reduction in VAT rebates to exporters. \par \par \uc2  The International Trade News forecast a surplus of about $5.0 billion in 1996. \par \par \uc2  "But the change in the... foreign trade balance will not be so great as to destabilise the exchange rate of the yuan," the SAEC official said. \par \par \uc2  The cut in import tariffs would not trigger an import boom, he said, noting that to offset the change Beijing was eliminating some tax breaks and reductions for foreign-funded enterprises that would dampen imports. \par \par \uc2  However, Tao Liming, deputy director of the International Finance Research Institute of the Bank of China said demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  would rise as imports outstripped exports. \par \par \uc2  "This... will leave the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  open to the pressure of slight depreciation," Tao was quoted as saying. \par \par \uc2  He said he expected China to record another net inflow of capital in 1996 although policies designed to help control the size of foreign debt might slow down the influx of overseas capital. He gave no details. \par \par \uc2  While there will probably be a balance in demand and supply of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he did not rule out the possibility that demand could exceed supply. \par \par \uc2  "That is to say the yuan will generally be stable, but a cheaper yuan is also likely," Tao said. \par \par \uc2  Qin Chijiang, director of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Finance Research Institute, said China's fast-growing \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, which soared to $73.5 billion at the end of December, would help to stabilise the exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  The yuan closed up at 8.3171 on Wednesday from 8.3180 against the U.S. dollar on the Shanghai-based interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market following \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cap the upward gain. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds1o043re\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
